---
import { activeEvent } from "@/config/events/active";
---

<section class="content-section section-shell" aria-labelledby="signature-title">
  <header class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">MOST IMPORTANT</p>
      <h2 id="signature-title">등록부 서명 안내</h2>
    </div>
    <p>29일과 30일은 오전·오후에 각각 한 번씩, 하루 두 번 서명해 주세요.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="signature-grid">
    {
      activeEvent.signatureDays.map((day) => (
        <article class:list={["signature-card", day.requiredCount === 2 && "signature-featured"]}>
          <header>
            <strong>{day.label.ko.split(".(")[0]}</strong>
            <span>
              {day.label.ko.includes("금")
                ? "금요일"
                : day.label.ko.includes("토")
                  ? "토요일"
                  : "일요일"}
            </span>
          </header>
          <div>
            {day.windows.map((window) => (
              <p>
                <span>{window.label.ko}</span>
                <strong>{window.time}</strong>
              </p>
            ))}
          </div>
          <b>{day.requiredCount}회 서명</b>
        </article>
      ))
    }
  </div>
  <p class="inline-notice">
    <span aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
    참석 확인 후 반드시 본인이 직접 서명해 주세요.
  </p>
</section>
